# GymAxis — Emergent Platform Deployment Exclusions (Iter 220be / F-30)
#
# Emergent's deploy step ignores any file listed here when building the
# production container, in addition to whatever `.dockerignore` and
# `.gitignore` already filter. Defence-in-depth — same rules as
# `.dockerignore` but listed separately so a future platform tweak
# can't silently drop one without the other.
#
# Anything that contains credentials, internal runbooks, security audit
# state, or dev-only scratch goes here.

# ── Memory / scratch / dev knowledge base ─────────────────────────
memory/
memory/**
/app/memory/
/app/memory/**

# ── Test credentials (HARD RULE) ──────────────────────────────────
**/test_credentials.md
test_credentials.md

# ── Pytest / coverage / lint caches ───────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
backend/tests/
backend/.pytest_cache/
test_reports/

# ── IDE / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Dev env overlays ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test
.env.test.local
*.env.local

# ── Front-end dev artefacts (rebuilt on deploy) ───────────────────
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.cache/
frontend/build/
frontend/dist/

# ── Git metadata ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/

# ── Misc dev docs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
README.md
SECURITY.md
CHANGELOG.md
ROADMAP.md
Makefile
